     <P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 13.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>为活跃校园文化氛围，激发学生学习热情，提高学生综合素质，展现当代中学生的活力，校团委决定举办“求真杯”辩论比赛。<SPAN style="COLOR: black">本次比赛由学生会学习部承办，现将有关事宜通知如下：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 13.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>一、<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">时间</B><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>2011</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 13.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>二、<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">赛制<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN></B>淘汰赛制<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 13.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -51.65pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 72.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: -4.9; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 1.96gd" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">三</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">、<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">组队<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt">高一年级每两个班级组成一队（抽签决定，不可自由组队），共八队。每班派两名同学参加，可自行商定一辩、二辩、三辩及四辩。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 13.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20.65pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>四、赛程<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
