<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 13.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>日（星期三）中午<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>各班班长在实南<SPAN lang=EN-US>-501</SPAN>室集合，将辩手名单上报学生会学习部，然后由单数班班长抽签决定比赛搭档，双数班班长抽取辩题同时确定正反方。依据辩题，将赛事分为<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>D</SPAN>四组。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
